        "text": "I think people should be good at what they do. And they also need to, in addition to their core skills, they need to exhibit the Binance cultures. So we are very user focused, we're collaborative, we are humble, we are hardcore. And more importantly, we look for people who are very passionate about crypto. Because Binance works in a remote, distributed fashion. We don't micromanage people. We can't, we can't micromanage people's hours. We don't have working hours for most positions. So if people are not passionate, they will easily slack off. So we need people who are very passionate, who are self driven, who believes in the mission, so who view this work as very enjoyable, as very meaningful.",
